{"id":"b279b5b4eb4a60be","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-thresholddegreeunique.md","title":"Threshold graphs are determined by their degree sequence","display":"thm-thresholddegreeunique — Threshold graphs are determined by their degree sequence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-thresholddegreeunique","aliases":["27-thm-thresholddegreeunique"],"display":"thm-thresholddegreeunique — Threshold graphs are determined by their degree sequence","depends_on":["[[27-df-thresholdgraph]]","[[27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions]]","[[27-df-graph]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.7 Definition 9.10 and Theorem 9.31","source_printed_pages":"440–441","source_pdf_pages":"464–465","verification_status":"source-statement-and-inductive-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-thresholddegreeunique"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-thresholddegreeunique</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thresholddegreeunique — Threshold graphs are determined by their degree sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa8f08f5040477a3\" href=\"?note=aa8f08f5040477a3\" title=\"27-df-thresholdgraph\">27-df-thresholdgraph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"13c327637bd1636b\" href=\"?note=13c327637bd1636b\" title=\"27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions\">27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.7 Definition 9.10 and Theorem 9.31"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"440–441"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"464–465"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-inductive-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=([n],E_G)\">\\(G=([n],E_G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=([n],E_H)\">\\(H=([n],E_H)\\)</span> 为有限简单图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{ThGraph}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa8f08f5040477a3\" href=\"?note=aa8f08f5040477a3\" title=\"27-df-thresholdgraph\">27-df-thresholdgraph</a>，消去判据见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"13c327637bd1636b\" href=\"?note=13c327637bd1636b\" title=\"27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions\">27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions</a>；边集投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Edges}\">\\(\\mathrm{Edges}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"448689b85eeddd41\" href=\"?note=448689b85eeddd41\" title=\"27-df-graph\">27-df-graph</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\{G,H\\}\">\\(K\\in\\{G,H\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_j(K)\">\\(d_j(K)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in[n]\">\\(j\\in[n]\\)</span>）及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(K)\">\\(d(K)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\deg_K(i)\\coloneqq|\\{v\\in[n]\\mid\\{i,v\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(K)\\}|\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\},\\ i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\deg_K(i)\\coloneqq|\\{v\\in[n]\\mid\\{i,v\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(K)\\}|\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\},\\ i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_j(K)\\coloneqq\\max\\{q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid j\\le|\\{v\\in[n]\\mid q\\le\\deg_K(v)\\}|\\}\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\},\\ j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_j(K)\\coloneqq\\max\\{q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid j\\le|\\{v\\in[n]\\mid q\\le\\deg_K(v)\\}|\\}\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\},\\ j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d(K)\\coloneqq(d_j(K))_{j\\in[n]}\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d(K)\\coloneqq(d_j(K))_{j\\in[n]}\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\land d(G)=d(H)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\sigma:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;\n\\left(\\{i,j\\}\\in E_G\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\sigma(i),\\sigma(j)\\}\\in E_H\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\land d(G)=d(H)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\sigma:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;\n\\left(\\{i,j\\}\\in E_G\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\sigma(i),\\sigma(j)\\}\\in E_H\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.31，印刷 pp.440–441／PDF pp.464–465。归纳删除度为0或n−1的点；另一图有相同度序，也有相应孤立点或支配点，删除后度序同步变化。较小图归纳同构，再恢复点即可。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0,1\">\\(n=0,1\\)</span> 直接成立；结论为同构唯一性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-thresholdgraph","status":"resolved","id":"aa8f08f5040477a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-thresholdgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions","status":"resolved","id":"13c327637bd1636b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-thresholdgraph","status":"resolved","id":"aa8f08f5040477a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E_G)$、$H=([n],E_H)$ 为有限简单图。$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，消去判据见 [[27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions]]；边集投影 $\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。对 $K\\in\\{G,H\\}$，$\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$d_j(K)$（$j\\in[n]$）及 $d(K)$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions","status":"resolved","id":"13c327637bd1636b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E_G)$、$H=([n],E_H)$ 为有限简单图。$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，消去判据见 [[27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions]]；边集投影 $\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。对 $K\\in\\{G,H\\}$，$\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$d_j(K)$（$j\\in[n]$）及 $d(K)$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"448689b85eeddd41","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E_G)$、$H=([n],E_H)$ 为有限简单图。$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，消去判据见 [[27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions]]；边集投影 $\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。对 $K\\in\\{G,H\\}$，$\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$d_j(K)$（$j\\in[n]$）及 $d(K)$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"G=([n],E_G)","display":false},{"tex":"H=([n],E_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Edges}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\{G,H\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"d_j(K)","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"d(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg_K(i)\\coloneqq|\\{v\\in[n]\\mid\\{i,v\\}\\in\\mathrm{Edges}(K)\\}|\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\},\\ i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"d_j(K)\\coloneqq\\max\\{q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\mid j\\le|\\{v\\in[n]\\mid q\\le\\deg_K(v)\\}|\\}\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\},\\ j\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"d(K)\\coloneqq(d_j(K))_{j\\in[n]}\\quad(K\\in\\{G,H\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\land d(G)=d(H)\\Rightarrow\\exists\\sigma:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;\n\\left(\\{i,j\\}\\in E_G\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\sigma(i),\\sigma(j)\\}\\in E_H\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"n=0,1","display":false}],"bytes":2004,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholddegreeunique|thm-thresholddegreeunique — Threshold graphs are determined by their degree sequence]]"}],"outgoing":["aa8f08f5040477a3","13c327637bd1636b","448689b85eeddd41"]}